---

<Layout
  title="Hindi Divas Celebration | Icon School of Excellence"
  description="Celebrate Hindi Divas at Icon School of Excellence with activities that highlight the richness of the Hindi language in Bangalore"
  keywords="Hindi Divas Bangalore, language day celebrations, school events, Icon School Hindi programs"
  robots="index, follow"
  canonical="https://iconschoolofexcellence.com/events/hindi-diwas"
>
  <EventsList
    event_title="Hindi Divas"
    event_sub_title="Explore the latest photos from our Hindi Divas celebration at ISOE"
    paragraph=` The Hindi Divas celebration at Icon School of
                                Excellence was a vibrant event that honored the
                                beauty of the Hindi language and culture.
                                Students gave inspiring speeches, performed
                                engaging plays, and recited poetry, while
                                traditional songs enriched the experience.
                                Teachers and parents joined in, fostering a
                                shared appreciation for our linguistic heritage,
                                making it a joyful and unifying event for the
                                school community`
    images={images}
  />
</Layout>
